LoadI PTR_Y
Store mayor
loop,  LoadI PTR_Y
	SkipCond 400
	Jump check_mayor
	Jump finish
check_mayor, Load PTR_Y //Para mover l direccion
	Add ONE
	Store PTR_Y
	LoadI PTR_Y
	Subt mayor
	SkipCond 800
	Jump loop
	LoadI PTR_Y
	Store mayor
	Jump loop
finish, Load mayor
	Output
	Halt

PTR_Y, ADR Y
Y, DEC 8
	DEC 20
	DEC 19
	DEC 15
	DEC 3
ONE, DEC 1
mayor, DEC 0
tmp, DEC 0